_out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Sample clips are large inputs. Kept out of the repo, unlike the images under input/.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4v

# Nothing from a video run is committed either: each frame json embeds its frame as
# base64, so a 124-frame clip is ~235 MB of output. Regenerate with run_video.sh.
# output/ov/ is negated back in - it holds the still path's previews.
output/*/
!output/ov/

# One-off batch fixups for a specific delivered run (see tmp/). Not pipeline code.
tmp/
